# Utopia Remade's quarrymen's sea door (CIPlay utopia_remade_cave, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# Points as in its recipe: the mouth on the sea floor at 90 -8 (flattened to -5 m), kit_st yaw 180 len 36 slope 18 size 0.7 -
# the culvert climbs to the dry chamber round 90 -53 (air zone ut_seadoor, chest at 90 -54). Swim in, breathe, take the chest,
# swim out. HEIGHT GUESSES (need a Raft surface probe): mouth floor -5, chamber floor ~+6, zone/chest h 8. The offset is the old one.
island Utopia Remade keep
offset 2.5752 -7.9918
hour 11
weather Calm

zone quarryseadoor
picture ut_sea_out 100 6 8 78 0 -14
walk 90 -4 to 90 -8 to 90 -22 to 90 -36 to 90 -46 to 90 -53 below=8
air ut_seadoor here
picture ut_sea_in 90 9 -46 90 7 -54 light=20
open Quarrymen's lower store
wait 2
expect item Bolt 4
air ut_seadoor
walk 90 -53 to 90 -46 to 90 -36 to 90 -22 to 90 -8 to 90 -4 below=8
